  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Slice mini flourtortillas into quarters. Finely chop red onion. Grate carrot. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves and tomato. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and onion, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add black beans, garlic paste and All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbf9f5e871cb9745535582-b66562ea.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in the butter, water, passata and vegetable stock pot, until combined and slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbf9f5e871cb9745535582-c14a796c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortilla pieces over a lined oven tray (don't worry if they overlap).\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Bake until lightly golden and crispy, 8-10 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine baby spinach leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbf9f5e871cb9745535582-6daa60c0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide smokey black bean chilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Top with spinach salsa and light sour cream. Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with tortilla chips. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bbf9f5e871cb9745535582-69b1b16b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
